  "body_html": "<p>Embrace the legend with the Jeminise Bigfoot Quilt, a perfect blend of adventure and comfort. Designed for nature enthusiasts and those who love the great outdoors, this quilt brings a unique touch to any bedroom or camping trip. Crafted from a soft and durable cotton and polyester blend, it offers cozy warmth and breathability for year-round enjoyment. Personalize your space or gift a thoughtful present to a Bigfoot lover with this versatile and eye-catching quilt.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Unique Bigfoot Design:</strong> Features a bold and playful Bigfoot design, ideal for nature lovers, campers, and outdoor enthusiasts.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Premium Quality Material:</strong> Made from a soft, durable blend of cotton and polyester, ensuring a cozy and breathable sleeping experience.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile &amp; Functional:</strong> Perfect for year-round comfort, functioning as a warm blanket for chilly nights or a stylish decorative bedding piece.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> This quilt is machine washable, making maintenance simple and ensuring long-lasting use.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Built to Last:</strong> Designed with high-quality stitching and vibrant, fade-resistant prints that maintain their sharpness even after multiple washes.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in Throw (60\"x70\"), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), and King (102\"x91\") to fit various bed sizes.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift:</strong> An excellent gift choice for Bigfoot enthusiasts, hunters, or anyone who enjoys outdoor adventures.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Cotton Blend</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Bigfoot Say Hi</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Cartoon</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Rodeo</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Queen, King, Twin, Full, Throw (60\"x70\"), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), King (102\"x91\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 Duvet Cover (or Comforter) + (Optional) Pillowcases</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Modern Themed</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
